{
  "id": "06066_shinpaisuru",
  "headword": "{心配|しんぱい}する",
  "reading": "しんぱいする",
  "part_of_speech": "verb (suru)",
  "gloss": "to worry, to be anxious",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "to worry, to be anxious, to be concerned",
      "explanation": "To feel uneasy or troubled about something that might happen or has happened."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "06066_shinpaisuru_ex1",
      "japanese": "{心配|しんぱい}しないでください。",
      "english": "Please don't worry.",
      "notes": "Very common expression",
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "06066_shinpaisuru_ex2",
      "japanese": "{子供|こども}の{将来|しょうらい}を{心配|しんぱい}している。",
      "english": "I'm worried about my child's future.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "06066_shinpaisuru_ex3",
      "japanese": "{心配|しんぱい}するほどのことではない。",
      "english": "It's nothing to worry about.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "06066_shinpaisuru_ex4",
      "japanese": "{親|おや}に{心配|しんぱい}をかけたくない。",
      "english": "I don't want to cause my parents worry.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "06066_shinpaisuru_ex5",
      "japanese": "{地震|じしん}のあと、{家族|かぞく}のことが{心配|しんぱい}で{何|なに}も{手|て}につかなかった。",
      "english": "After the earthquake, I was so worried about my family that I couldn't focus on anything.",
      "notes": null,
      "has_audio": false,
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    }
  ],
  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY: {他動詞|たどうし} (transitive). Pattern: Xを{心配|しんぱい}する (worry about X) / Xのことを{心配|しんぱい}する (be worried about X).\n\nASPECT: ている indicates ongoing state. {心配|しんぱい}している = 'is worried' or 'is worrying.'\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n・{心配|しんぱい}をかける (cause worry to someone)\n・{心配|しんぱい}が{募|つの}る (worry grows)\n・{心配|しんぱい}ない (no worries)\n・ご{心配|しんぱい}なく (don't worry - polite)\n\nRELATED: The noun {心配|しんぱい} alone is very commonly used: {心配|しんぱい}だ (I'm worried).",
